@startuml
title Figure 8 — Analysis history review
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 52

actor Operator
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "Security + HTTP\nboundary" as Boundary
participant "Analysis application" as Analysis
participant "AnalysisHistoryPort" as History
participant "History adapter" as Adapter
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Operator -> UI : open prior analyses
UI -> Boundary : GET customer history [HTTP/JSON]
alt unauthenticated
  Boundary --> UI : reject / redirect
  UI --> Operator : authentication required
else authenticated
  Boundary -> Analysis : listHistory(customerId, operator)
  Analysis -> History : listByCustomer(customerId)
  History -> Adapter : JpaAnalysisHistoryAdapter
  Adapter -> DB : JDBC SELECT analysis_history
  DB --> Adapter : persisted analyses
  Adapter --> History : AnalysisHistoryEntry[]
  History --> Analysis : AnalysisHistoryEntry[]
  Analysis --> Boundary : history projection
  Boundary --> UI : 200 JSON
  UI --> Operator : list + inspect prior analyses
end

note right of History
  The application port returns project-owned AnalysisHistoryEntry values;
  JPA rows do not cross the persistence boundary.
end note
@enduml
